#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "The 1.0.5 notes now say that headless MCP works on macOS and Linux only for now, and that an approved script or one of your add-ons can still write the .blend Angelo opens, since only Angelo's own edits go to a new file."
msgstr "1.0.5 的发行说明现已注明：headless MCP 目前仅适用于 macOS 和 Linux；由于只有 Angelo 自己的编辑会存入新文件，已批准的脚本或您的某个插件仍可写入 Angelo 打开的 .blend。"

#. src: angelo_agent/providers_page_model.py
msgid "The accounts Angelo's agent works with. Each chat uses the one you choose, never a fallback."
msgstr "Angelo 的智能体所使用的账户。每个对话都使用您选择的账户，绝不会改用备用账户。"

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "The agent can check a hand rig for anatomy and weight problems, measure where fingers touch, and show each pose beside the rest pose."
msgstr "智能体可以检查手部骨架的解剖结构和权重问题，测量手指接触的位置，并将每个姿势与静止姿势并排显示。"

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "The agent can edit a full character's armature again; every change to a rig with long finger chains was refused."
msgstr "智能体可以再次编辑完整角色的骨架；此前对带有长手指链的骨架所做的任何更改都会被拒绝。"

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "The agent can now look at OpenEXR images in the PIZ, PXR24, B44, B44A, DWAA, DWAB and HTJ2K codecs, and at tiled images."
msgstr "智能体现在可以查看采用 PIZ、PXR24、B44、B44A、DWAA、DWAB 和 HTJ2K 编解码器的 OpenEXR 图像以及分块图像。"

#. src: angelo_agent/providers_page_model.py
msgid "The agent can split a large job into parts that worker agents build at the same time, each shown live in the Sessions panel."
msgstr "智能体可以将大型任务拆分为多个部件，由工作智能体同时构建，每个部件都会在会话面板中实时显示。"

#. src: angelo_agent/providers_page_model.py
msgid "The agent can split a large job into parts that worker agents build at the same time, each shown live on the session rail."
msgstr "智能体可以将大型任务拆分为多个部件，由工作智能体同时构建，每个部件都会在会话栏中实时显示。"

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "The agent keeps sight of what an edit did to the World, motion and shared data in long conversations, instead of losing those facts when older results are shortened."
msgstr "在较长的会话中，智能体会持续掌握编辑对世界环境、运动和共享数据做了什么，而不会在较早的结果被缩短时丢失这些信息。"

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "The agent poses hands: a natural closed fist, a curled finger or any hand pose, inside each joint's limits."
msgstr "智能体可以摆放手部姿势：自然握紧的拳头、弯曲的手指或任何手部姿势，都在每个关节的限制范围内。"

#. src: angelo_agent/chosen_tools.py
msgid "The agent starts from your rig's hands and Angelo's hand tools"
msgstr "智能体从你的绑定手部和 Angelo 的手部工具开始"

#. src: angelo_agent/view_editor.py
msgid "The agent was sent a picture of your window as you see it ({editors}), with any file paths shown there; text editors, consoles, the file browser and the status bar were greyed out."
msgstr "已将您所见的窗口画面（{editors}）连同其中显示的所有文件路径发送给智能体；文本编辑器、控制台、文件浏览器和状态栏已置灰。"

#. src: angelo_agent/view_editor.py
msgid "The agent was sent a picture of your {editor} as you see it, with any file paths shown in it."
msgstr "已将您所见的 {editor} 画面连同其中显示的所有文件路径发送给智能体。"

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "The agent was told the wrong size for curves, outline text and lattices: a thin curve read about 2 m wide, and a lattice read 0. Sizes now come from the geometry Angelo shows."
msgstr "智能体此前获得的曲线、轮廓文本和晶格尺寸有误：细曲线被读成约 2 米宽，晶格则读成 0。现在尺寸来自 Angelo 显示的几何数据。"

#. src: angelo_agent/approvals.py
msgid "The agent will run Blender Python to make these changes. Review the exact code before approving."
msgstr "智能体将运行 Blender Python 来进行这些更改。批准之前请审查确切的代码。"

#. src: angelo_agent/plan_runaway.py
msgid "The agent's reply kept streaming without finishing, far past the length of any plan, so Angelo stopped it and asked again. Nothing in that reply ran."
msgstr "智能体的回复一直在流式输出却没有结束，远远超过任何计划的长度，因此 Angelo 停止了它并重新请求。该回复中的任何内容都没有运行。"

